{"name":"Imnescar","status":"ok","title":"Imnescar","pageId":79762,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Imnescar</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Town</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amn\" title=\"Amn\">Amn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/West_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"West Faerûn\">west Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">17,000<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p10_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p10-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Imnescar</b> was a small town in southwest <a href=\"/wiki/Amn\" title=\"Amn\">Amn</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p10_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p10-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Imnescar?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Imnescar was considered an agricultural center for the nation's south and was famous for its fruits. These included <a href=\"/wiki/Orange\" title=\"Orange\">oranges</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tangerine\" title=\"Tangerine\">tangerines</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Grape\" title=\"Grape\">grapes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Date\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Date\">dates</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lemon\" title=\"Lemon\">lemons</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lime\" title=\"Lime\">limes</a>, avocados, and <a href=\"/wiki/Artichoke\" title=\"Artichoke\">artichokes</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p10_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p10-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Imnescar was also known to be a popular waystation for those traveling along the <a href=\"/wiki/Trade_Way\" title=\"Trade Way\">Trade Way</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p10_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p10-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Imnescar?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the <a href=\"/wiki/479_DR\" title=\"479 DR\">Year of Forestsfrost, 479 DR</a>, Prince <a href=\"/wiki/Imnel_Torlath\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Imnel Torlath\">Imnel Torlath</a> and his armies fought ogres on the <a href=\"/wiki/Small_Teeth\" title=\"Small Teeth\">Small Teeth</a>, restoring trade between <a href=\"/wiki/Crimmor\" title=\"Crimmor\">Crimmor</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Murann\" title=\"Murann\">Murann</a>. The site of the battle was known as <i>Imnel's Scar</i>, and would later became the town of Imnescar.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI2-A-p21_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI2-A-p21-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Imnescar?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"></span></td>\n<td><i>This Realmslore article about a geographical location is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:stub\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:stub\">stub</a>.  You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Imnescar?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Imnescar?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-EotS-p10-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-EotS-p10_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-EotS-p10_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-EotS-p10_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-EotS-p10_1-3\">1.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scott_Haring\" title=\"Scott Haring\">Scott Haring</a>&#160;(1988). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Empires_of_the_Sands\" title=\"Empires of the Sands\">Empires of the Sands</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 10. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-